{"text": "Morris suddenly threw the paw into the fire, but Mister White cried out and quickly pulled it out again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you were wise, you would let it burn, the soldier said, but Mister White wanted to keep it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Before he left, Morris warned his friend once more, If you must wish, wish for something sensible. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After Morris had gone, Herbert laughed and said that the story of the paw was probably just another soldiers tale. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Mister White held the paw and said that he did not know what to wish for, because he already had everything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If you only cleared the debt on the house, you would be quite happy, Herbert said, so wish for two hundred pounds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Holding the paw up high, Mister White said the words clearly, I wish for two hundred pounds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At that moment he gave a cry and dropped the paw, saying that it had twisted in his hand like a snake. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But no money appeared, and the three sat by the fire in a silence that felt strangely heavy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Before going to bed, Herbert joked that they would find the money in a big bag in the middle of their bed.", "alignment": {"characters": ["M", "o", "r", "r", "i", "s", " ", "s", "u", "d", "d", "e", "n", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "r", "e", "w", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "a", "w", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "f", "i", "r", "e", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "M", "i", "s", "t", "e", "r", " ", "W", "h", "i", "t", "e", " ", "c", "r", "i", "e", "d", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "q", "u", "i", "c", "k", "l", "y", " ", "p", "u", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "i", "t", " ", "o", "u", "t", " ", "a", "g", "a", "i", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "f", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "w", "i", "s